# xunit v3 runs on Microsoft.Testing.Platform. This is the documented opt-in for driving it through
# `dotnet test`, but it does not take effect on the SDK in use here (10.0.400) - `dotnet test` still
# routes through the VSTest target and fails. Kept because it is harmless and correct if a later SDK
# honours it.
#
# Until then, run the suite the way CI does:
#   dotnet run --project tests/Api.Tests/Api.Tests.csproj
[dotnet.test:runner]
name = "Microsoft.Testing.Platform"
